# Canonical author identity.
#
# The `Cranot`, `Dimitris` and `t` identities are all the same person, spread
# across machines and git configs over the life of the repo. Folding them here
# makes `git shortlog`, `git blame`, `git log --use-mailmap` and GitHub's
# contributor graph agree, without rewriting published history.
